WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:26.000
Coco and I are best friends.

2
00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:40.823
Once a day, I brush Coco.

3
00:00:40.824 --> 00:00:55.619
Twice a day, I feed Coco.

4
00:00:55.620 --> 00:01:03.008
I hug Coco all the time.

5
00:01:03.009 --> 00:01:14.007
Once a day, Coco cleans her paws.

6
00:01:14.008 --> 00:01:47.268
Twice a day, Coco chases birds.

7
00:01:47.269 --> 00:01:58.374
Coco kisses me all the time.

8
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:16.021
Coco is my best friend.
